{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@property","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"nonatomic","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"assign","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BOOL","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@BOOL"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"showsScale","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The scale bar may not be shown at all zoom levels. The scale bar becomes visible"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when the maximum distance visible on the map view is less than 400 miles (800"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"kilometers). The zoom level where this occurs depends on the latitude at the map"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"view’s center coordinate, as well as the device screen width. At latitudes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"farther from the equator, the scale bar becomes visible at lower zoom levels."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The unit of measurement is determined by the user’s device locale."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The view controlled by this property is available at "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"scaleBar"},{"type":"text","text":". The default value"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of this property is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NO"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A Boolean value indicating whether the map may display scale information."}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapview\/showsscale"]}],"metadata":{"r